🧾 SQL Practice — SELECT & Filtering

📌 Overview

This folder contains my hands-on practice of SQL SELECT and Filtering operations using a real-world styled E-commerce Orders dataset made using AI.

The goal of this practice was to build a strong foundation in:

* Extracting data from tables
* Applying conditions to filter data
* Sorting and limiting results
* Handling NULL values
* Using pattern-based searches


🗂️ Dataset Used

Table Name: orders

The dataset simulates an e-commerce platform with the following columns:

* order_id — Unique identifier for each order
* customer_name — Name of the customer
* city — Customer location
* category — Product category (Electronics, Clothing, Home)
* product — Product purchased
* order_date — Date of order
* amount — Order value
* payment_method — Mode of payment (UPI, Card, COD)


The dataset includes:

* 50+ rows
* Multiple cities and categories
* NULL values for realistic scenarios


🧠 Concepts Practiced

🔹 Basic Data Retrieval

* Selecting all columns
* Selecting specific columns

🔹 Filtering Data

* WHERE clause
* Comparison operators (=, >, <, !=)
* Logical operators (AND, OR, NOT)

🔹 Advanced Filtering

* BETWEEN for range queries
* IN / NOT IN
* LIKE for pattern matching (%, _)

🔹 NULL Handling

* Filtering NULL values
* Filtering NOT NULL values

🔹 Sorting & Limiting

* ORDER BY (Ascending & Descending)
* LIMIT for top N records


💻 Sample Queries

*** Show all records

SELECT * FROM orders;

*** Show only customer_name and city

SELECT customer_name, city
FROM orders;

*** Find all orders from Delhi

SELECT * FROM orders
  WHERE city IN ("Delhi");

*** Find orders where price is in the range 1000 to 5000

SELECT * FROM orders 
WHERE price BETWEEN 1000 AND 5000;

*** Find orders where products are Mobile & Laptop

SELECT * FROM orders 
WHERE product IN ('Mobile', 'Laptop');

*** Get orders from Mumbai where amount > 5000

SELECT * FROM orders 
WHERE city = 'Mumbai' AND price > 5000;

*** Show orders where category is Clothing and quantity >= 4

SELECT * FROM orders 
WHERE category = 'Clothing' AND quantity >= 4;

*** Get orders where payment_method is Card or UPI

SELECT * FROM orders 
WHERE payment_mode = 'Card' OR payment_mode = 'UPI';


